# Visual Studio solution cache. Machine-local, regenerated on open, and it locks
# files while the IDE is running, which fails an unattended `git add`.
.vs/

# Generated by Visual Studio for the project it happened to open. The entrypoint is
# Marites.Host, so a profile for Marites.Api points at the wrong project and carries
# random ports. A launch profile worth sharing should be written deliberately.
**/Properties/launchSettings.json
